  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "part-i",
      "label": "Part I",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The poor boy from the blacksmith shop has gotten above their station~"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5651564a6b30fda9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "That love-blinded young fool... Does he really believe that he can escape the quagmire of power with his loved one and find this so-called happiness ever after?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6639e380c2746a4f"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "part-ii",
      "label": "Part II",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "How could a Gardener in the Garden of Life be a bad person?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e6bbbdaaa28993b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They are all pure and noble scholars that cannot be blinded by wealth or tempted into breaking the law... They must be, right?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c493c3436842879d"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "volumeKey": "part-iii",
      "label": "Part III",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What should I do when I grow weary of daily life in the baths?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-701e67650831008d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Go and talk to the staff~ The architects, the mathematicians, the \"cleaners\"... If you can get them to open up to you, you're bound to be entertained."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9639b72586533f39"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
